=== ferryman ===
{ferryman > 1: -> again}
Hei! Welcome ashore.
Walk with the arrow keys or WASD, or tap where you want to go. Press E, or tap someone, to talk.
Everyone here has a story about {profile("firstName")}. His house is the red one up the road.
* [Who's {profile("firstName")}?]
    {profile("name")}. {profile("tagline")}
    He'll tell you himself. He likes talking about it.
* [Just looking around.]
    Good. There's plenty to look at. Most of it is his fault.
- If you'd rather read than walk, the Journal has everything in plain text.
-> END

= again
{~The ferry's late again. It's always late.|The fjord's calm today.|Still here? Go and explore.|I've been rowing this route for thirty years. The ferry only has an engine for show.}
-> END
